### HBO MAX Platform API Tests
### 使用 VS Code REST Client 擴充套件或類似工具測試

@baseURL = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = 

### ============================================
### 認證 API 測試
### ============================================

### 1. 註冊新用戶
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test123456"
}

### 2. 登入用戶
# @name login
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test123456"
}

### 3. 登入管理員
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@hbomax.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 4. 取得當前用戶資訊
GET {{baseURL}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 影片 API 測試
### ============================================

### 5. 取得所有影片（無驗證）
GET {{baseURL}}/videos

### 6. 取得所有影片（帶分頁）
GET {{baseURL}}/videos?page=1&limit=6

### 7. 取得影片（帶分類篩選）
GET {{baseURL}}/videos?category=action

### 8. 搜尋影片
GET {{baseURL}}/videos?search=超人

### 9. 取得特定影片詳情
GET {{baseURL}}/videos/[VIDEO_ID]

### 10. 新增影片（需認證）
POST {{baseURL}}/videos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "測試影片",
  "description": "這是一部測試影片",
  "thumbnail": "https://via.placeholder.com/400x225",
  "videoUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/test",
  "duration": 120,
  "category": "action",
  "releaseYear": 2025,
  "director": "測試導演",
  "cast": ["演員1", "演員2"]
}

### 11. 更新影片（需認證）
PUT {{baseURL}}/videos/[VIDEO_ID]
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "更新後的影片標題",
  "description": "更新後的描述"
}

### 12. 刪除影片（需認證）
DELETE {{baseURL}}/videos/[VIDEO_ID]
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. 增加觀看次數
PUT {{baseURL}}/videos/[VIDEO_ID]/view

### ============================================
### 評論 API 測試
### ============================================

### 14. 取得影片的所有評論
GET {{baseURL}}/comments/video/[VIDEO_ID]

### 15. 新增評論（需認證）
POST {{baseURL}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "videoId": "[VIDEO_ID]",
  "content": "這部影片太棒了！"
}

### 16. 更新評論（需認證）
PUT {{baseURL}}/comments/[COMMENT_ID]
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "更新後的評論內容"
}

### 17. 刪除評論（需認證）
DELETE {{baseURL}}/comments/[COMMENT_ID]
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 評分 API 測試
### ============================================

### 18. 取得影片平均評分
GET {{baseURL}}/ratings/video/[VIDEO_ID]

### 19. 取得用戶對影片的評分
GET {{baseURL}}/ratings/video/[VIDEO_ID]/user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20. 新增或更新評分（需認證）
POST {{baseURL}}/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "videoId": "[VIDEO_ID]",
  "score": 8
}

### ============================================
### 播放清單 API 測試
### ============================================

### 21. 取得用戶的播放清單（需認證）
GET {{baseURL}}/playlists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 22. 取得特定播放清單（需認證）
GET {{baseURL}}/playlists/[PLAYLIST_ID]
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 23. 新增播放清單（需認證）
POST {{baseURL}}/playlists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "我的收藏清單",
  "description": "收集我最喜歡的影片",
  "isPublic": false
}

### 24. 更新播放清單（需認證）
PUT {{baseURL}}/playlists/[PLAYLIST_ID]
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "更新後的清單名稱",
  "description": "更新後的描述"
}

### 25. 刪除播放清單（需認證）
DELETE {{baseURL}}/playlists/[PLAYLIST_ID]
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 26. 新增影片到播放清單（需認證）
POST {{baseURL}}/playlists/[PLAYLIST_ID]/videos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "videoId": "[VIDEO_ID]"
}

### 27. 從播放清單移除影片（需認證）
DELETE {{baseURL}}/playlists/[PLAYLIST_ID]/videos/[VIDEO_ID]
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 收藏 API 測試
### ============================================

### 28. 取得用戶收藏清單（需認證）
GET {{baseURL}}/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 29. 新增收藏（需認證）
POST {{baseURL}}/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "videoId": "[VIDEO_ID]"
}

### 30. 移除收藏（需認證）
DELETE {{baseURL}}/favorites/[VIDEO_ID]
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 31. 檢查是否已收藏（需認證）
GET {{baseURL}}/favorites/[VIDEO_ID]/check
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 健康檢查
### ============================================

### 32. 伺服器健康檢查
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### ============================================
### 錯誤測試
### ============================================

### 33. 測試無效的 Email 格式
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "test123456"
}

### 34. 測試密碼太短
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### 35. 測試未認證訪問受保護資源
GET {{baseURL}}/playlists

### 36. 測試無效 Token
GET {{baseURL}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here

### 37. 測試不存在的影片 ID
GET {{baseURL}}/videos/000000000000000000000000

### 38. 測試評分超出範圍
POST {{baseURL}}/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "videoId": "[VIDEO_ID]",
  "score": 15
}
